Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libyal/libluksde

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libyal/libluksde/archive/refs/tags/20260902.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libluksde-20260902-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libluksde-20260902-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libluksde-20260902-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libluksde-20260902-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libluksde1-20260902-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libluksde-devel-20260902-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-libluksde-20260902-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libluksde)
  /usr/bin/luksdeinfo.exe
  /usr/bin/luksdemount.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libluksde.README
  /usr/share/doc/libluksde/AUTHORS
